{
  "id": "m30l1",
  "title": {
    "es": "Recursión: funciones que se llaman a sí mismas",
    "en": "Recursion: functions that call themselves"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Resolver dividiendo en casos más pequeños"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Una función **recursiva** se llama a sí misma con una entrada menor hasta llegar a un **caso base** que se resuelve directamente. Sin caso base, la recursión no termina."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "def factorial(n):",
          "    if n <= 1:        # caso base",
          "        return 1",
          "    return n * factorial(n - 1)   # caso recursivo",
          "",
          "print(factorial(4))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "24"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Toda recursión necesita: 1) un caso base, y 2) acercarse a él en cada llamada."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Solving by splitting into smaller cases"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "A **recursive** function calls itself with a smaller input until it reaches a **base case** that's solved directly. Without a base case, recursion never ends."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "def factorial(n):",
          "    if n <= 1:        # base case",
          "        return 1",
          "    return n * factorial(n - 1)   # recursive case",
          "",
          "print(factorial(4))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "24"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Every recursion needs: 1) a base case, and 2) to move toward it on each call."
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m30l1e1",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `factorial_rec(n)` de forma recursiva (sin usar bucles ni math).",
        "en": "Define `factorial_rec(n)` recursively (no loops, no math)."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def factorial_rec(n):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def factorial_rec(n):",
        "    if n <= 1:",
        "        return 1",
        "    return n * factorial_rec(n - 1)"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "Caso base n<=1 -> 1; si no, n * factorial_rec(n-1)."
        ],
        "en": [
          "Base case n<=1 -> 1; else n * factorial_rec(n-1)."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "factorial_rec",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                5
              ],
              "expected": 120
            },
            {
              "args": [
                0
              ],
              "expected": 1
            },
            {
              "args": [
                1
              ],
              "expected": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m30l1e2",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `suma_rec(lista)` que sume la lista de forma recursiva.",
        "en": "Define `suma_rec(lista)` summing the list recursively."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def suma_rec(lista):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def suma_rec(lista):",
        "    if not lista:",
        "        return 0",
        "    return lista[0] + suma_rec(lista[1:])"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "Caso base: lista vacía -> 0; si no, primero + suma del resto."
        ],
        "en": [
          "Base case: empty list -> 0; else first + sum of the rest."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "suma_rec",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  1,
                  2,
                  3
                ]
              ],
              "expected": 6
            },
            {
              "args": [
                []
              ],
              "expected": 0
            },
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  10
                ]
              ],
              "expected": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}